    <!-- Friction prompts: one is picked at random per pause, from the set matching how long the
         app has been used today (calm at first, blunter as the time adds up). -->
    <string-array name="friction_lines_calm">
        <item>Take a breath. Do you really need it right now?</item>
        <item>What were you about to do before you picked up the phone?</item>
        <item>Are you looking for something, or just something?</item>
        <item>The urge passes on its own in a minute.</item>
        <item>Nothing wrong with going in. But you don\'t have to.</item>
        <item>Did you choose this, or did your thumb?</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="friction_lines_mid">
        <item>You\'ve been here already today. Did you find what you came for?</item>
        <item>How many more times today?</item>
        <item>You can come back later. It\'ll still be there.</item>
        <item>This is time you don\'t get back.</item>
        <item>What if you let this one go?</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="friction_lines_direct">
        <item>There\'s nothing new.</item>
        <item>This isn\'t a decision. It\'s a reflex.</item>
        <item>You\'ve given it enough today.</item>
        <item>Nothing in there is waiting for you.</item>
        <item>You know how this ends.</item>
        <item>Really? Again?</item>
    </string-array>

